sequenceDiagram
    title GET /api/enrollments
    actor User as User (Admin/Teacher/Parent)
    participant UI as EnrollmentsUI
    participant Endpoint as :EnrollmentsController
    participant Service as :EnrollmentService
    participant DB as :UnitOfWork
    participant Database as :Database

    User->>UI: 1.1 Yêu cầu danh sách ghi danh xếp lớp
    activate UI
    UI->>Endpoint: 2.1 GET /api/enrollments (pageNumber, pageSize, status, classId, learningLevel)
    activate Endpoint

    Endpoint->>Service: 3.1 GetListEnrollmentAsync(pageNumber, pageSize, status, classId, learningLevel)
    activate Service

    Service->>DB: 3.2 EnrollmentRepository.GetAllWithDetailsAsync()
    activate DB
    DB->>Database: 3.3 Execute SELECT with child, classroom, program details
    activate Database
    Database-->>DB: 3.4 List of Enrollment entities
    deactivate Database
    deactivate DB

    note over Service: Filter list by status, classId, learningLevel in memory<br/>Apply Skip/Take pagination

    Service-->>Endpoint: 3.5 PagedResponse of EnrollmentResponse
    deactivate Service
    Endpoint-->>UI: 3.6 200 OK (PagedResponse of EnrollmentResponse)
    deactivate Endpoint
    deactivate UI
